# 1. Sign up free at https://www.themoviedb.org/signup
# 2. Go to Settings > API > request an API key (choose "Developer", it's instant)
# 3. Copy your API key (v3 auth) below
# 4. Rename this file to .env (remove ".example")
#
# The PUBLIC_ prefix is required by Astro to expose this to browser-side JS.
PUBLIC_TMDB_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
